    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.DatetimeIndex.microsecond#\n\n- \n*property* DatetimeIndex.microsecond[source]#\n- The microseconds of the datetime. Examples >>> datetime_series = pd.Series( ... pd.date_range(\"2000-01-01\", periods=3, freq=\"us\") ... ) >>> datetime_series 0 2000-01-01 00:00:00.000000 1 2000-01-01 00:00:00.000001 2 2000-01-01 00:00:00.000002 dtype: datetime64[ns] >>> datetime_series.dt.microsecond 0 0 1 1 2 2 dtype: int32",
